<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.carriage.accepts ~ consent first: track contracts, never identities

`lares nexus accept-carriage [--index N] [--nexus <aid>]` runs on the joining operator's own vessel: it signs the per-Nexus leaf and that charter's head epoch into the token the kahu supply to `nexus contract --sig`, and keeps a copy for that one Nexus.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ accept

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`accept` params=`index/1 ~ mint the token for face h1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ index · nexus

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the face whose leaf signs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ a charter this vessel holds; absent, the primary`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/persona-leaf ~ signs with your persona leaf on your own vessel`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ token

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`token` params=`exit/0 ~ the token to hand the kahu`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

